				title: 'Environment Production I–III',
				description: 'This progressive studio course sequence develops the skills required to create production-ready 3D environments for both real-time and offline workflows. Students explore modular workflows, hard-surface and organic asset creation, materials, lighting, composition, optimization, world-building, and engine integration while producing increasingly complex environments for games and cinematic applications.',
