					{ name: 'Soft Forms', description: 'Pablanders gio soft forms brush.', howToUse: '1. Download the .ZBP file.\n2. In ZBrush, open the Brush palette and click Import.\n3. Select the downloaded .ZBP file.\n4. The brush will appear in your brush inventory and can be saved to your startup brushes.\nSource: <a href="https://www.pablander.academy/newsletter/the-gio-brush" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline">Pablander Academy — The Gio Brush</a>', logos: [zbrushLogoImg], thumbnail: zbrushBrushSoftForms, download: '/downloads/uiw3d-soft-forms.zbp' },
